From 8610007d9d5835ffd7160b14bdcfdf1c260409d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 14:07:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Vercel build: apply Suspense fix, remove stray patch file

The previous commit (df6971b) accidentally committed the .patch file
itself instead of applying it, so the actual code fix never landed
and the build kept failing with the same useSearchParams error.

This applies the real fix: split /checkout/pay into an inner
CheckoutPayContent component (holds useSearchParams) wrapped by the
default export in <Suspense>. Also removes the stray patch file from
the repo.
---
 T15b-checkout-pay-suspense-fix.patch | 54 ----------------------------
 app/checkout/pay/page.tsx            | 19 +++++++++-
 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 55 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 T15b-checkout-pay-suspense-fix.patch

diff --git a/T15b-checkout-pay-suspense-fix.patch b/T15b-checkout-pay-suspense-fix.patch
deleted file mode 100644
index 1503321..0000000
--- a/T15b-checkout-pay-suspense-fix.patch
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,54 +0,0 @@
-From c04041949dc87c736e2f8738144c90502eb34ccf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
-From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
-Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 14:01:07 -0700
-Subject: [PATCH] Fix Vercel build: wrap useSearchParams in Suspense on
- /checkout/pay
-
-Next.js requires useSearchParams() to be wrapped in a Suspense
-boundary for static prerendering. Split the page into an inner
-CheckoutPayContent component (holds the useSearchParams logic) and
-a default export that wraps it in <Suspense>, fixing the 3rd
-consecutive Vercel build failure.
